      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Navegação conforme CSS oficial.",
      "html": "<nav><button class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Tamanho da letra e tema\">Aa</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{min-height:40px;padding:0 14px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--line2,#CFC3AC);background:var(--panel,#fff);color:var(--ink,#221E18);font:500 15px Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav:hover{border-color:var(--accent,#0E6B55)} :focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#0E6B55);outline-offset:2px}"
